     * (if an ETag is cached). The JSON format is an array of [key, value] pairs,
     * e.g.: `[["Accept","application/json"],["X-App-Id","my_app"]]`
     */
    func configHeadersJson() throws -> String

    /**
     * Return the full URL for the remote config endpoint.
